    <DataNode elementId="AT1G49430-MONOMER" textLabel="Long chain acyl-CoA synthetase 2" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9XIA9" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="635" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The Arabidopsis genome contains nine functional genes encoding long-chain acyl-CoA synthetase - |FRAME: AT2G47240 LACS1|, |FRAME: AT1G49430 LACS2|, |FRAME: AT1G64400 LACS3|, |FRAME: AT4G23850 LACS4|, |FRAME: AT4G11030 LACS5|, |FRAME: AT3G05970 LACS6|, |FRAME: AT5G27600 LACS7|, |FRAME: AT2G04350 LACS8| and |FRAME: AT1G77590 LACS9| |CITS: [12177484]|. Genetic and biochemical evidence have sorted the physiological roles of some of them. |FRAME: AT1G49430 LACS2| is required for |FRAME: Cutins cutin| biosynthesis. |FRAME: AT1G49430 LACS2| was shown to activate the cutin monomer |FRAME: 16-HYDROXYPALMITATE 16-hydroxypalmitate| |CITS: [14973169]|. The resulted |FRAME: CPD-17621 16-hydroxypalmitoyl-CoA| is a substrate for the second hydroxylation to yield another cutin monomer, |FRAME: 1016-DIHYDROXYPALMITATE 10,16-dihydroxypalmitate|. The |FRAME: AT1G49430 LACS2| mutant shows defects in the cutin layer. Mutant plants have reduced leaf size, reduced seed production, and lower rates of seed germination and seedling growth.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G49430-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT1G49430.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9XIA9" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR000873" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF00501" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="Q9XIA9" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prosite" value="PS00455" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Smr" value="Q9XIA9" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9XIA9" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="Protein Botrytis resistant 1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="LATERAL ROOT DEVELOPMENT 2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-12158, RXN-12157, RXN-12653, RXN-6366" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G49430.1" />
      <Property key="EnzymeNotUsedIn" value="RXN-10695" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G49430" />
